{"candidateAnswer":"Lots of love and emotional connection","evidence":"[D2:15 | 2:42 pm on 2 April, 2023] Audrey: You'll love them! They're great for cuddles and companionship.\n[D23:18 | 4:22 pm on 13 October, 2023] Audrey: I think i've said this so many times, but I really can't imagine my life without them - my little family. They always make me smile and give lots of love and companionship. Remember I had a tattoo of my four dogs? So I went to the tattoo parlor and got some more drawings on the tattoo.","itemId":"urn:uuid:3c68f1f7-3a5f-562d-ab1d-c71fdb585e08","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:6ce0a2fd3eab82111da0a0dd8a1cce17f91073c4598badd17871bd085889a4a8","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What did Audrey get wtih having so many dogs?","referenceAnswer":"Companionship","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"6ce0a2fd3eab82111da0a0dd8a1cce17f91073c4598badd17871bd085889a4a8"}}]}